<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH DEC JOBLESS RATE EDGES UP TO 3.5PCT (3.3PCT).</title>
<headline>CZECH DEC JOBLESS RATE EDGES UP TO 3.5PCT (3.3PCT).</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in the Czech Republic in December was 186,339, or 3.5 percent of the total workforce, up from 3.3 percent in November, the Ministry of Labour and Social Affairs said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p> CZECH UNEMPLOYMENT    DEC 96     NOV  96     DEC 95</p>
<p>  number of jobless    186,339    175,842     153,041</p>
<p>  pct of workforce	 3.50	 3.30	  2.90</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
